OL,5,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FVisit two is to Johnny Dough's
OL,7,     FRestaurant with Rooms in Conwy,
OL,8,     FNorth Wales. After a boat trip,
OL,9,     Fhost Morgan reveals his surprising
OL,10,     Fpast. Will his efforts produce
OL,11,     Fgood scores in the feedback?
OL,12,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FWe're off to the Peak District for
OL,14,     Fthe week's third visit, at The
OL,15,     FRoyal Oak, run by Kadir. But two
OL,16,     Fsets of guests experience some
OL,17,     Fmouldy misery in their bathrooms.
