OL,5,G1030 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe last visit of the week is to
OL,7,     FThe Dovecote Inn in
OL,8,     FNottinghamshire, run by Sam and
OL,9,     FSophie. Can their cracking
OL,10,     Fcontinental turn things around
OL,11,     Fafter an underwhelming day out?
OL,12,G1105 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FOn payment day, cutlery quibbles,
OL,14,     Fgrout gripes and breakfast
OL,15,     Fbombshells are debated, before the
OL,16,     Fpayments are revealed and the
OL,17,     Fwinner is announced.
