OL,5,G1135 Come Dine with Me
OL,6,     FNorth Devon. The first host,
OL,7,     Feco-campaigner Hector Christie,
OL,8,     Fserves up a menu of raw food and
OL,9,     Fhome-grown produce. But his guests
OL,10,     Fare more impressed by his stately
OL,11,     Fhome. (Ep1/5)
OL,12,G1205 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FNorth Devon. Former cabaret queen
OL,14,     Fand make-up artist Kirsten goes
OL,15,     Fback to her roots with a Danish
OL,16,     Fnight. Her traditional menu is a
OL,17,     Fhit, but what do the guests make
OL,18,     Fof her singing? (Ep2/5)
