OL,13,     Fand simple B&B, The Red Lion
OL,14,     FCountry Inn in Upper Poppleton,
OL,15,     FNorth Yorkshire. But their guests
OL,16,     Ffind the rooms bland and the hosts
OL,17,     Fget a grilling at dinner.
